{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 44, :comments ["<b>Some of them had wives</b> — its meaning: there were some of these who had wives, and they had already set sons. The meaning is either that they fathered sons from them, or \"they set sons\" according to the heads of the fathers' houses, to take counsel what to do with them — whether to divorce them or whether to bring them near."], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:42:25.010316803Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}